OL,3,GNEWSADangerous driver jailed again     
OL,4,Aafter victim died                      
OL,6,FA "maniac" dangerous driver who was    
OL,7,Fjailed for seriously injuring three    
OL,8,Fpassengers in a crash has been         
OL,9,Fimprisoned again after one of his      
OL,10,Fvictims died.                          
OL,12,FBanned driver Adam Richardson, 39, was 
OL,13,Fspeeding on a wet country lane near    
OL,14,FBlackhall Colliery, County Durham, in  
OL,15,FApril 2019 when he smashed into a tree,
OL,16,FTeesside Crown Court heard.            
OL,18,FOne of the passengers, mother of two   
OL,19,FEmma Parkinson, was left quadriplegic  
OL,20,Fand died six years later from illness  
OL,21,Flinked to her injuries.                
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
