OL,3,GNEWSADangerous driver jailed again     
OL,4,Aafter victim died                      
OL,6,FRichardson, who initially told police  
OL,7,Fsomeone else had been driving, admitted
OL,8,Fcausing death by dangerous driving. He 
OL,9,Fwas jailed for three years, having     
OL,10,Fpreviously being sentenced to almost   
OL,11,Fsix years for causing serious injury.  
